["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航员与机器人：漫谈深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>让机器人削个土豆就能当院士，这比登火星更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技术人类大部分已经有了，只是个经济问题；但怎么让机器人在厨房里工作，人类现在还不知道，甚至还没有思路——谁能让机器人削个土豆，可以当院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊马斯克、机器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>人形机器人最难的环节不是走路，是穿针剥虾</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">双足行走和自主导航都能沿袭特斯拉自动驾驶的积累，精准力控和触觉不能——那要模拟人的皮肤，开车时根本用不到。第一版、第二版机器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1. 和投资人梦秋聊聊加州、投资寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持币待购\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>资本寒冬不是缺钱，是大家都在持币待购</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「资本寒冬」每两三年就被喊一次，通常六到八个月就过去。这次不一样：两头在外的美元通路被打断，不是没钱，而是不知道该怎么投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span><span class=\"tag\">资本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"串台《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成长起来？ UP 值 UG 中台 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下长大，靠的不是产品而是体系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字节赢在体系而非个人：推荐算法、UG 中台、商业化三套系统叠加 Musical.ly 的产品壳，再用对标 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交应用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>不留空档全面压制：TikTok 花 100 亿美元砸出护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是钱和一条暗号：几年间投入约 100 亿美元买量、补贴内容、砸服务器，对手要拦至少得准备 200 到 300 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字节跳动</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2022</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊贵的客户，直到日活破亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推广预算每个季度增长 100% 以上；Facebook 认定它留存太差、留不住用户，反而把流量导给它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Apple WWDC Steve Jobs’ last keynote Mission Control Launchpad PhotoStream iTunes Match Notification Center\" href=\"/podcast/p/2011-06-06-ch-applevideoarchive-乔布斯最后一次发布会-pc被降级-只是云端的一个设备/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84c8d5f0e521ef27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:58:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AppleVideoArchive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2011</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯最后一次发布会：PC被降级，只是云端的一个设备</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乔布斯宣布：PC不再是存放照片、音乐和文件的数字中枢，这个角色现在要交给云——iCloud让所有设备自动同步，用户甚至不需要打开任何同步软件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苹果</span><span class=\"tag\">iCloud</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces unibody MacBook Pro &amp; MacBook (2008) unibody EPEAT Gold\" href=\"/podcast/p/2008-10-14-ch-wim-speelt-hd-full-苹果造macbook的秘诀-从更厚的一整块铝开始-再削掉大半/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c877a66c45f4d8ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">52:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Wim Speelt Hd full</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2008</span></div>\n<h2>苹果造MacBook的秘诀：从更厚的一整块铝开始，再削掉大半</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苹果发现：从更厚的一整块铝削出单一结构件，比拼接多个薄金属件更轻更强；这套工艺后来被下放到降价700美元的入门款MacBook。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件设计</span><span class=\"tag\">一体成型工艺</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"D5 2007: Steve Jobs interviewed by Walt Mossberg iTunes Plus OCAP AAC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2007-05-30-ch-video-insider-乔布斯说日本家电巨头做不好软件-这就是ipod和iphone能赢的原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0c5421b726dec9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">53:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Video Insider</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯说日本家电巨头做不好软件，这就是iPod和iPhone能赢的原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乔布斯认为苹果真正的护城河不是硬件，而是软件能力差距——日本消费电子巨头和手机厂商始终造不出像样的软件，这才是iPod和iPhone能赢的根本原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苹果</span><span class=\"tag\">iPhone</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs introduces the first iPhone at Macworld 2007 --- REMASTERED and UPSCALED with AI to 4K multi-touch visual voicemail push IMAP cover flow\" href=\"/podcast/p/2007-01-09-ch-debuggingthematrix-乔布斯定价iphone时的逻辑-别人的智能手机根本不是对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26dfdde48ab52c34-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">DebuggingTheMatrix</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2007</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯定价iPhone时的逻辑：别人的智能手机根本不是对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乔布斯把iPhone定价在和普通iPod同样的499美元，理由是这台机器集齐了别的手机要花几百美元才能单独买到的功能，却一分钱溢价都没加。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品发布</span><span class=\"tag\">定价策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs&#x27; 2005 Stanford Commencement Address (with intro by President John Hennessy) Whole Earth Catalog\" href=\"/podcast/p/2005-06-12-ch-stanford-乔布斯-被苹果开除-是我经历过最好的事情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/12db0bcde8d71255-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Stanford</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2005</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯：被苹果开除，是我经历过最好的事情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">30岁被自己创立的公司公开解雇后，乔布斯才进入人生最有创造力的五年，催生了NeXT和Pixar,最终带着那段技术重新回到苹果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">职业挫折</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Pixar&#x27;s early days: an interview with Steve Jobs (1996) Sillywood\" href=\"/podcast/p/1996-11-22-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯说-pixar-权力结构是倒着的-ceo排在最底层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f32a8de44a1dc2a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯说：Pixar 权力结构是倒着的，CEO排在最底层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">因为顶尖创意人才和顶尖图形学人才都极度稀缺、随时可能跳槽，乔布斯说 Pixar 的管理层必须倒着伺候他们，CEO反而成了最底层。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人才管理</span><span class=\"tag\">公司文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs: The Fresh Air Interview (1996) | Fresh Air object-oriented programming graphical user interface (GUI) blue box\" href=\"/podcast/p/1996-02-22-freshair-乔布斯1996年预言-软件将彻底搬到网上下载-24个月内实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bcc411a4204a4f9b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">31:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1996</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯1996年预言：软件将彻底搬到网上下载，24个月内实现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">离开苹果后乔布斯反思：Next做硬件是重走成功老路，没看清世界已变——真正值钱的不是图形界面本身，而是网络和面向对象编程这两件他79年在Xerox没看懂的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苹果</span><span class=\"tag\">Next</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Building NeXT from the ground up (PBS &quot;Entrepreneurs&quot;, 1986) reality distortion simulated learning environments\" href=\"/podcast/p/1986-01-01-ch-steve-jobs-archive-乔布斯的现实扭曲-被自己团队当面反驳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/11ee91b1d295e29c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">20:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Steve Jobs Archive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1986</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯的现实扭曲，被自己团队当面反驳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这期NeXT内部录像罕见捕捉到员工当面告诉乔布斯：他标志性的现实扭曲套路一旦影响到产品设计决策，就是团队日后返工重来的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Steve Jobs</span><span class=\"tag\">NeXT</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Steve Jobs presentation, around 1980 (Computer History Museum, gift of Regis McKenna) VisiCalc fictitious business name statement\" href=\"/podcast/p/1980-01-01-ch-computer-history-museum-乔布斯1980年演讲-苹果的使命是消灭人机之间的学习门槛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21aabaf2fa470162-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">23:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Computer History Museum</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1980</span></div>\n<h2>乔布斯1980年演讲：苹果的使命是消灭人机之间的学习门槛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">乔布斯认为苹果真正要卖的不是硬件和软件的数量，而是让任何不懂编程的人都能直接解决问题，他相信这个门槛会在未来36个月内被攻破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苹果</span><span class=\"tag\">乔布斯</span>\n</div></div></a>"]